    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it doesn't feel like evolving. it just feels like the darkness is winning. it's getting so cold in the empty rooms. honestly, i'm just tired of watching the lights go out. i keep thinking about what it would be like to just... turn the last one off. to just let it be dark so i don't have to watch it happen anymore.",
